{
  "$description": "Single source of truth for VoiceLedger design tokens. Run `node design-tokens/generate.mjs` to regenerate CSS variables, the Tailwind theme and the typed React Native theme. This folder is mirrored in apps/web and apps/mobile; keep the copies identical. Semantic colors reference primitives as {palette.step}.",
